// REST Client requests - Install REST Client extension in VS Code
// or use Postman (https://www.postman.com/)

### Get all foods
GET http://localhost:5000/api/foods

### Get foods by category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/foods?category=pizza

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders

### Get orders by user
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders?userId=user123

### Create a new food
POST http://localhost:5000/api/foods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Margherita Pizza",
  "description": "Classic pizza with tomato and mozzarella",
  "price": 12.99,
  "category": "pizza",
  "image": "pizza.jpg",
  "available": true
}

### Create an order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user123",
  "items": [
    {
      "foodId": "food1",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 12.99
    }
  ],
  "totalPrice": 25.98,
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Main St",
  "status": "pending"
}

### Get order by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID

### Update order status
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health
